"""Stateful backend bridge between Native SwiftUI AutoApply.app and the isolated Python runtime.

Repository: https://github.com/CryptoDiveX/autoapply-app
Extension:  https://github.com/CryptoDiveX/autoapply-extension
Handoff:    https://github.com/CryptoDiveX/autoapply-handoff

Key Responsibilities:
- Persists all workspace state (`workspace_state.json`), SQLite candidate memory
  (`candidate_memory.db`), Knowledge Base Markdown sections (`knowledge_base/*.md`),
  imported reference resumes (`resumes/`), and rendered 2-page Resume + 1-page
  Cover Letter PDF/DOCX artifacts (`artifacts/`) under `AUTOAPPLY_APP_SUPPORT`.
- Enforces strict host coexistence: never reads, writes, or touches `~/.hermes`.
- Drives isolated Chromium browser partitions on CDP ports `19221..19225`, including
  automatic human-latency typing (`Input.insertText` at 85-145ms/char) and mouse
  confirmation (`Input.dispatchMouseEvent`) for OpenAI Codex Device OAuth
  (`_cdp_human_type_and_confirm_codex_device_code` / `_run_codex_device_worker`).
"""

